 Foto, Mail e Calendario, miglioramenti all’interfaccia e aggiornamenti per AirDrop, i widget e molto altro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/50-New-macOS-Golden-Gate-Features-and-Changes-Worth-Checking-Out-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"50-New-macOS-Golden-Gate-Features-and-Changes-Worth-Checking-Out-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17858,\"date\":\"2026-09-18T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-18T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-watchos-27-2-tvos-27-2-visionos-27-2\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta di watchOS 27.2, tvOS 27.2 e visionOS 27.2\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha reso disponibili le prime versioni beta di watchOS 27.2, tvOS 27.2 e visionOS 27.2, aprendo la fase di test per le piattaforme dedicate a Apple Watch, Apple TV e Vision Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17856,\"date\":\"2026-09-18T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-18T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prima-beta-macos-golden-gate-27-2-sviluppatori\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la prima beta di macOS Golden Gate 27.2 agli sviluppatori\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple avvia la beta di macOS Golden Gate 27.2 per gli sviluppatori. Il test arriva a pochi giorni dal rilascio di macOS Golden Gate 27.0 e riaccende le attese su funzioni di Apple Intelligence e su Suggestions in Messaggi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17850,\"date\":\"2026-09-17T13:08:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-17T11:08:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"kids-act-ue-stop-social-under-13-chatbot-ai\",\"title\":\"Kids Act UE: stop ai social per under 13 e limiti per chatbot AI\",\"excerpt\":\"L’UE prepara il Kids Act: divieto di social media per i minori di 13 anni senza supervisione, regole più stringenti tra 13 e 15 e obblighi di tutela anche per gaming e chatbot AI.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/european-commission-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"european-commission\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17848,\"date\":\"2026-09-17T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-17T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-interrompe-backup-time-machine-airport-time-capsule\",\"title\":\"Reminder: macOS 27 interrompe i backup Time Machine su AirPort Time Capsule\",\"excerpt\":\"Con macOS 27, Time Machine non potrà più eseguire backup su AirPort Time Capsule: viene rimosso il supporto AFP e i backup passano esclusivamente a SMB.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/time-capsule-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"time-capsule\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17854,\"date\":\"2026-09-17T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-17T10:24:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-apple-reference-image-negativo-digitale\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro, Apple Reference Image: il “negativo digitale” per attestare lo scatto\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro Max, Apple introduce Apple Reference Image: una modalità che mira a dimostrare che una foto è stata scattata davvero con un iPhone e non è stata modificata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-18-pro-apple-reference-image-1-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-apple-reference-image-1-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17846,\"date\":\"2026-09-17T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-17T10:24:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-watch-ultra-3-vs-ultra-4-guida-all-acquisto\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Ultra 3 vs Ultra 4: guida all’acquisto\",\"excerpt\":\"Ultra 4 in pre-order: nuovo sistema di rilevazione della salute, più memoria e autonomia estesa. Confronto completo con Ultra 3 e consigli per scegliere.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/apple-watch-ultra-3-and-ultra-4-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-watch-ultra-3-and-ultra-4\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17852,\"date\":\"2026-09-17T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-17T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-tornare-mercato-server-tecnologia-nvidia\",\"title\":\"Apple potrebbe tornare nel mercato server con tecnologia Nvidia\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple valuta un ritorno nel mercato dei server integrando tecnologie Nvidia, con un possibile focus su infrastrutture per l’AI e data center.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"ht